Key / touch / notification event listeners (AScript `ascript.android.event`).

    @KeyEvent.on(key_code=KeyEvent.VOLUME_UP)
    def on_vol(event):
        if event.action == "down": ...

    @NotificationEvent.on(package="com.tencent.mm")
